# Objective:
Retrieve the password for bandit5 stored in the only human-readable file inside the inhere directory

breakdown:
The inhere directory contains multiple files, most of which consist of raw binary data.
 Running file ./* inspects the file header of every file in the directory simultaneously to locate the single human-readable file (marked as ASCII text), which can then be read using cat.

Command:
cd inhere
file ./*
cat ./-file07
